[{"id":"cnp_h110_q101","topicId":"cnp_h110","difficulty":"standard","level":"pro","origin":"original","type":"numeric","prompt":"某透明介质折射率为1.5，真空光速取3.0×10⁸ m/s。光在其中的速度是几×10⁸ m/s？（填写前面的系数）","answer":"2","verify":"3/1.5","explanation":"n=c/v，所以v=c/n=2.0×10⁸ m/s，所填系数为2。"},{"id":"cnp_h110_q102","topicId":"cnp_h110","difficulty":"standard","level":"pro","origin":"original","type":"choice","prompt":"单色光由空气射入某透明玻璃，频率保持不变，若玻璃折射率为n，则玻璃中的波长约为空气中的","explanation":"波速变为原来的1/n，频率不变，由λ=v/f，波长也变为原来的1/n。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"1/n"},{"key":"B","text":"n倍"},{"key":"C","text":"n²倍"},{"key":"D","text":"不变"}],"answer":"A","verify":"\"1/n\""},{"id":"cnp_h110_q103","topicId":"cnp_h110","difficulty":"challenge","level":"pro","origin":"original","type":"choice","prompt":"从空气斜射入玻璃的光，入射光与界面的夹角为30°，折射光与法线夹角为30°。忽略空气折射率偏离1，玻璃折射率为","explanation":"入射角与法线夹角为60°，n=sin60°/sin30°=√3，不能直接使用与界面的夹角。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"1"},{"key":"B","text":"1/√3"},{"key":"C","text":"2"},{"key":"D","text":"√3"}],"answer":"D","verify":"\"√3\""}]
